            <div xml:id="d915">

                <pb facs="0866" n="860" sameAs="frus:frus1939v04/pg860"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">390D.11/186: Telegram</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Ambassador in Turkey</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                        >MacMurray</hi>) <hi rendition="#italic">to the Secretary of
                    State</hi></head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right"><placeName><hi rendition="#small-caps"
                                >Istanbul</hi></placeName>, <date calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1939-12-29T14:00:00+02:00">December 29, 1939—2
                        p.m.</date><lb/>[Received 7:48 p.m.]</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>75. My telegram No. 147, November 21, 5 p.m.</p>
                <list>
                    <label>1.</label>
                    <item>Turks desire that agreement be in the form of a treaty. The Minister of
                        the Interior takes the position that this is necessary for administrative
                        purposes. Has the Department any objection?</item>
                    <label>2.</label>
                    <item>For the Department’s information, while the Foreign Office is insisting
                        that its counterproposals (inclosed in my despatch No. 1277, <pb facs="0867"
                            n="861" xml:id="pg861"/> November 23, 1939) be used as the basis of
                        discussions, they appear disposed to make the changes necessary to bring it
                        into substantive accord with the draft of exchange of notes worked out in
                            Washington.<anchor n="15" xml:id="d915-f1"/></item>
                </list>
                <closer><signed><hi rendition="#small-caps">MacMurray</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
    <standOff>
        <listAnnotation>
            <note corresp="#d915-f1" n="15" xml:id="d915-f1-content">
